        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Dawidi abwira iyo ntumwa ati “Uzabwire Yowabu utya uti ‘Ibyo ntibikubabaze, kuko inkota yica umuntu irindiriye undi. Urusheho gukomeza urugamba, urwane n'umudugudu uwutsinde.’ Kandi nawe umurindishe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
