              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko hanyuma yo kumwerera, Dawidi aramutumira amushyira iwe, amugira umugore we. Bukeye babyarana umwana w'umuhungu, ariko icyo Dawidi yakoze icyo cyarakaje Uwiteka.",
